---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Off-Grid Living | Sunshine Tiny Houses"
  description="Go off-grid with OFFGRID NOW solar and battery power, Ecoflo composting toilets, Cinderella incinerating toilets, rainwater harvesting and greywater systems, built into your tiny house or modular home."
  canonical="https://www.sunshinetinyhouses.com.au/off-grid/"
>

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Off-Grid Living</p>
      <h1>Sustainable Off-Grid Solutions</h1>
      <p class="page-hero__sub">Live independently, reduce your footprint, and cut your living costs — all in a beautifully built tiny home.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container og-intro">
      <h2>Self-Sufficient Living, Built Into Your Home</h2>
      <p>At Sunshine Tiny Houses, sustainability is at the heart of what we do. We offer comprehensive off-grid solutions for those seeking to reduce their environmental footprint and living expenses. Whether you want a fully independent home or simply want to reduce reliance on the grid, we can design and install the systems you need.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--surface">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our Off-Grid Options</p>
      <h2>What We Offer</h2>
      <div class="og-systems">

        <div class="og-card">
          <div class="og-card__icon">&#x2600;&#xFE0F;</div>
          <h3>Solar Power</h3>
          <p>Our solar and battery systems come from our power partner OFFGRID NOW&reg; (below): a pre-wired cabinet sized to your home, from basic lighting and appliances to full off-grid living with battery backup.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Rooftop solar panels sized to your load</li>
            <li>Lithium battery storage for overnight and cloudy days</li>
            <li>Inverter/charger system for AC power throughout the home</li>
            <li>Compatible with grid tie-in if desired</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="og-card__brands">
            <img class="og-card__logo-ogn" src="/images/partners/offgrid-now-logo-dark.png" alt="OFFGRID NOW" width="718" height="326" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="og-card">
          <div class="og-card__icon">&#x1F6BD;</div>
          <h3>Waterless Toilets</h3>
          <p>No sewer connection needed: ideal for rural blocks, properties without mains sewerage and fully off-grid homes. We fit two kinds, chosen to suit your site and how you live.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Composting:</strong> Ecoflo, Australian made and owned, with over 40 years in composting toilets. Waste breaks down into compost, with no chemicals and no smell.</li>
            <li><strong>Incinerating:</strong> Cinderella, made in Norway. Waste is burned to a small amount of clean ash, with no plumbing and no water.</li>
            <li>No flush water, so less load on your tanks</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="og-card__brands">
            <img src="/images/partners/ecoflo-logo.webp" alt="Ecoflo" width="936" height="354" loading="lazy" />
            <img src="/images/partners/cinderella-logo.svg" alt="Cinderella" width="350" height="90" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="og-card">
          <div class="og-card__icon">&#x1F4A7;</div>
          <h3>Rainwater Harvesting</h3>
          <p>Capture and store rainwater from your roof for drinking, cooking, and washing. A well-designed rainwater system can provide all the water you need on most Queensland properties.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>First-flush diverter for water quality</li>
            <li>Tank sizing matched to your rainfall and usage</li>
            <li>Pump and filtration system for mains-pressure delivery</li>
            <li>UV or filter purification options for drinking water</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="og-card">
          <div class="og-card__icon">&#x267B;&#xFE0F;</div>
          <h3>Greywater Systems</h3>
          <p>Treat the water from your sinks, shower and laundry and reuse it on the garden, using Ecoflo greywater treatment systems. It cuts your total water use and takes load off your wastewater system.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Greywater diversion and treatment</li>
            <li>Compliant with Queensland greywater regulations</li>
            <li>Suitable for gardens, lawns and irrigation</li>
            <li>Pairs with a waterless toilet for a fully off-grid home</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="og-card__brands">
            <img src="/images/partners/ecoflo-logo.webp" alt="Ecoflo" width="936" height="354" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Power partner. Facts from OFFGRID NOW's partnership proposal (7 Oct 2026) and
       October 2026 brochure. Logo from offgridnow.com.au (they asked us to show it). -->
  <section class="section og-partner" aria-labelledby="og-partner-h">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="og-partner__head">
        <img src="/images/partners/offgrid-now-logo-reverse.png" alt="OFFGRID NOW" width="240" height="112" loading="lazy" />
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Our power partner</p>
          <h2 id="og-partner-h">Power from day one with OFFGRID NOW&reg;</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="og-partner__intro">OFFGRID NOW&reg; designs and builds Australian-made solar and battery power cabinets at Coolum Beach, just down the road from our Noosaville factory. Your cabinet arrives pre-wired and tested, we fit it in our factory while your home is being built, and your home is delivered with its power system installed. No waiting months for a grid connection before you can move in.</p>

      <ul class="og-partner__points">
        <li><strong>Built in Queensland</strong> Weatherproof aluminium cabinets made at Coolum Beach, Australian Made certified.</li>
        <li><strong>10-year cabinet warranty</strong> Designed by an RPEQ electrical engineer and built to AS/NZS 5139.</li>
        <li><strong>On your phone</strong> Live solar, battery and usage on the DEYE Cloud app, with remote support from the OFFGRID NOW team.</li>
        <li><strong>On-grid or off-grid</strong> Systems can be set up to switch between grid and off-grid, with automatic generator backup.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="og-partner__table-h">Which system suits your home?</h3>
      <p class="og-partner__note">A starting guide. Every system is sized to how you live, so we'll confirm yours with OFFGRID NOW&reg; during your design consult.</p>
      <div class="og-partner__table-wrap">
        <table class="og-partner__table">
          <thead>
            <tr><th scope="col">Your home</th><th scope="col">System</th><th scope="col">Inverter</th><th scope="col">Battery</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>1770, Little Cove, Bondi</td><td>Flat White 5</td><td>5 kW</td><td>10 kWh</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Granite Bay, Castaways, 1-bedroom modular homes</td><td>Excelso 6</td><td>6 kW</td><td>15 kWh</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Boiling Pot, Lennox, 2-bedroom modular homes</td><td>Daily Grind 8</td><td>8 kW</td><td>20 kWh</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Multiple homes, retreats, holiday parks</td><td>Robusta 12</td><td>12 kW</td><td>30 kWh</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="og-partner__more">Learn more at <a href="https://www.offgridnow.com.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">offgridnow.com.au</a>, or <a href="/contact/">ask us</a> about adding a power system to your build.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container og-benefits">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why Go Off-Grid?</p>
      <h2>The Benefits of Independent Living</h2>
      <div class="benefits-grid">
        <div class="benefit">
          <h3>Lower Living Costs</h3>
          <p>Eliminate or significantly reduce electricity, water and sewerage bills. Solar and rainwater pay for themselves over time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit">
          <h3>Energy Independence</h3>
          <p>No more power outages or price hikes. Generate your own power and store it for when you need it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit">
          <h3>Location Freedom</h3>
          <p>Park on rural land, a rural block, or a property without mains services — your home works wherever you are.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit">
          <h3>Reduced Environmental Impact</h3>
          <p>Smaller footprint, renewable energy, water recycling — off-grid living is one of the most sustainable choices you can make.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit">
          <h3>Resilience</h3>
          <p>Immune to grid failures, water restrictions, and supply disruptions. Your home keeps running no matter what.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit">
          <h3>Future-Proof Investment</h3>
          <p>As energy and water costs continue to rise, off-grid systems become more valuable every year.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--dark">
    <div class="container og-cta">
      <h2>Interested in Off-Grid Living?</h2>
      <p>Talk to us about designing your off-grid package. We'll help you choose the right systems for your property, climate and budget.</p>
      <div class="og-cta__btns">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--accent">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <a href="tel:0753158365" class="btn btn--ghost">(07) 5315 8365</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
.page-hero {
  background: var(--color-surface-dark);
  color: #fff;
  padding: 4rem 0 3rem;
}
.page-hero h1 { color: #fff; }
.page-hero__sub { color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); margin-top: .75rem; font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 560px; }

.og-intro h2 { margin-bottom: 1rem; max-width: 700px; }
.og-intro p { color: var(--color-text-body); max-width: 760px; }

.og-systems {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 1.5rem;
  margin-top: 2.5rem;
}
.og-card {
  background: #fff;
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 2rem;
}
.og-card__icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.og-card h3 { margin-bottom: .65rem; }
.og-card > p { color: var(--color-text-body); font-size: .92rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.og-card ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .4rem; }
.og-card ul li {
  font-size: .87rem;
  color: var(--color-text-body);
  padding-left: 1.1rem;
  position: relative;
}
.og-card ul li strong { color: var(--color-text); }
.og-card__brands { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1.5rem; padding-top: 1.25rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
.og-card__brands img { height: 40px; width: auto; }
.og-card__brands .og-card__logo-ogn { height: 56px; }
.og-card ul li::before {
  content: '✓';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  color: var(--color-primary);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.benefits-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 1.75rem;
  margin-top: 2.5rem;
}
.benefit h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
.benefit p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--color-text-body); }

.og-cta { text-align: center; }
.og-cta h2 { color: #fff; margin-bottom: .75rem; }
.og-cta p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 560px; margin-inline: auto; }
.og-cta__btns { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: .9rem 2rem;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background .2s, transform .15s;
  text-align: center;
}
.btn--accent { background: var(--color-accent); color: #fff; }
.btn--accent:hover { opacity: .9; transform: translateY(-2px); }
.btn--ghost { background: transparent; color: #fff; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.5); }
.btn--ghost:hover { border-color: #fff; }

.og-partner { background: var(--color-primary); color: #fff; }
.og-partner h2, .og-partner h3, .og-partner strong { color: #fff; }
.og-partner p, .og-partner li, .og-partner td { color: rgba(255,255,255,.88); }
.og-partner .eyebrow { color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); }
.og-partner a { color: #fff; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
.og-partner__head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
.og-partner__head img { width: 200px; height: auto; }
.og-partner__intro { max-width: 760px; }
.og-partner__points { list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1rem 2rem; margin: 2rem 0 2.5rem; }
.og-partner__points li { font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.6; }
.og-partner__points strong { display: block; margin-bottom: .2rem; }
.og-partner__table-h { margin-bottom: .4rem; }
.og-partner__note { font-size: .92rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.og-partner__table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
.og-partner__table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; font-size: .95rem; }
.og-partner__table th { text-align: left; padding: .75rem 1rem; background: rgba(0,0,0,.18); color: #fff; font-weight: 700; }
.og-partner__table td { padding: .75rem 1rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); }
.og-partner__table td:first-child { color: #fff; }
.og-partner__more { margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: .95rem; }
@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .og-partner__points { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .og-partner__table th, .og-partner__table td { padding: .6rem .6rem; font-size: .88rem; }
}

@media (max-width: 860px) {
  .og-systems { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .benefits-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .benefits-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
